HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/customerIO(apiKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let segment = try HTTPDestination.segment(","    writeKey: writeKey,","    region: .us,  \/\/ or .eu, where the workspace is","    plan: plan)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The body is a JSON object of content type ","type":"text"},{"code":"application\/json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with one member, ","type":"text"},{"code":"batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", an array","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of track calls, one per record, oldest first, with these members:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Member","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The record’s session, its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"text":", as a lowercase UUID string; the record’s own ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord\/id"},{"text":" when its context has no session","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The standard context, in the spec’s field names (below), and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ip"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0.0.0.0\""}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"event","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event\/name"},{"text":", as it is","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"messageId","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord\/id"},{"type":"text","text":", as a lowercase UUID string; a redelivered record keeps it"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"properties"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s stored properties, by name","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request_ip"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0.0.0.0\""},{"text":", in RudderStack’s calls alone","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the event was tracked, in ISO 8601 with milliseconds, in UTC"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"track\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session is the only identifier sent: there is no ","type":"text"},{"code":"userId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", no ","type":"text"},{"code":"identify","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call, no traits,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and no ","type":"text"},{"code":"context.device.id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"advertisingId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". An endpoint counts a user per ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymousId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its anonymous users are sessions. A record with no session (one tracked by a tracker without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is its own anonymous user, linked to nothing: the spec rejects a call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with neither a ","type":"text"},{"code":"userId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" nor an ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymousId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A record a store recovers after a relaunch keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its session, so it goes out with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymousId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"messageId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of its first send. Segment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deduplicates calls by ","type":"text"},{"code":"messageId","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" over about the last 24 hours, and drops most duplicates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than all, so a recovered record Segment had already stored before the app ended is most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"likely not stored again. RudderStack’s and Customer.io’s references don’t say whether they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deduplicate. The record’s vendor identifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and trace context, and any other context value, aren’t sent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in every call, which the spec reads as the user’s address, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Segment records no address from the request. RudderStack fills in a "},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" member from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request unless the call has one, even when "},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set, and passes it on to its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations, so RudderStack’s calls also carry "},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Customer.io’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"references don’t say whether "},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" takes the place of the address it reads from an HTTP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. No call to Segment or Customer.io carries "},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which their specs don’t have."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No "},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"originalTimestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"channel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is sent. Without "},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the endpoint takes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as it is, uncorrected for the device’s clock; it is left out on purpose, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retried request sends the same body again, whose "},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" would be the first attempt’s."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"RudderStack, whose references list all three as required, fills them in from when it received"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the call."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyReader"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"null"},{"text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"null"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context"},{"type":"text","text":" holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value for:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"app"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApplicationKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"namespace","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the bundle identifier, ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"build","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", each left out when ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; no ","type":"text"},{"code":"app","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when all three are","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DeviceKey","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"model"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type"},{"type":"text","text":", the platform as Segment’s Swift library names it: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios"},{"type":"text","text":" for a phone or pad, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"macos"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tvos"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"watchos"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"visionos"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"locale","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocaleKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The locale’s BCP 47 identifier, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"en-US","type":"codeVo